{"id":71297,"date":"2026-10-29T19:14:53","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:14:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71297"},"modified":"2026-10-29T20:16:12","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:16:12","slug":"corrida-de-sao-martinho-da-gandara-gold-residence","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-de-sao-martinho-da-gandara-gold-residence\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida de S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara \u2013 Gold Residence 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida de S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara \u2013 Gold Residence 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida de S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara \u2013 Gold Residence 2027<\/strong> (1\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>7 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, na freguesia de <strong>S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>). Organizada pela <strong>Palavras R\u00e1pidas<\/strong> e pela <strong>Junta de Freguesia de S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara<\/strong>, esta estreia rodovi\u00e1ria concentra a partida, a meta e o secretariado junto ao edif\u00edcio da Junta de Freguesia.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento \u00e9 composto pela <strong>Corrida de Estrada de 10 km<\/strong> (com tiro de partida \u00e0s <strong>09h45<\/strong>, limitada a 400 atletas e aberta a maiores de 18 anos nos escal\u00f5es S\u00e9nior, V40, V50 e V60) e pela <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>10h00<\/strong>, de car\u00e1cter l\u00fadico e limitada a 200 participantes). O percurso em asfalto disp\u00f5e de posto de abastecimento l\u00edquido e s\u00f3lido aos 5 km e na meta, tempo limite de 2 horas (at\u00e9 \u00e0s 11h45) e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os 5 primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina. Descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a> e calcula o teu ritmo na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box