 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 11,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida de S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 1\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 7 de fevereiro de 2027, com partida e chegada na Junta de Freguesia de S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara, no concelho de Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is (Aveiro). A corrida de 10 km parte \u00e0s 09h45 e a caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 10h00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 10 de novembro de 2026 a 31 de janeiro de 2027 (ou at\u00e9 atingir 400 vagas na corrida e 200 na caminhada). At\u00e9 10 de dezembro, a Corrida 10 km custa 11,00 \u20ac e a Caminhada 5 km custa 8,00 \u20ac; ap\u00f3s 10 de dezembro, os valores passam para 14,00 \u20ac (Corrida) e 11,00 \u20ac (Caminhada).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e onde s\u00e3o levantados os dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, T-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimento l\u00edquido e s\u00f3lido (aos 5 km e na meta) e medalha finisher. O levantamento de dorsais decorre na Junta de Freguesia de S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara no dia 6 de fevereiro (09h00\u201313h00 e 15h00\u201318h00) e no dia 7 de fevereiro (07h45\u201309h00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existem pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios e escal\u00f5es na corrida de 10 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9us para os 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (S\u00e9nior 18-40, M\/F 40, M\/F 50 e M\/F 60), s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 5 primeiros da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral masculina e feminina: 100 \u20ac (1\u00ba), 50 \u20ac (2\u00ba), 30 \u20ac (3\u00ba), 20 \u20ac (4\u00ba) e 10 \u20ac (5\u00ba).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite para concluir a prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo m\u00e1ximo de prova \u00e9 de 2 horas (at\u00e9 \u00e0s 11h45), momento a partir do qual o tr\u00e2nsito rodovi\u00e1rio \u00e9 reaberto.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corrida de S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara \u2013 Gold Residence 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-07\", \"endDate\": \"2027-02-07\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Junta de Freguesia de S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara, Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A 1\u00aa Corrida de S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara 2027 realiza-se a 7 de fevereiro em Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is com Corrida 10 km e Caminhada 5 km. Inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-corrida-de-sao-martinho-da-gandara-gold-residence.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida de Estrada 10 km\", \"price\": \"11.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/corrida-sao-martinho-da-gandara-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 5 km\", \"price\": \"8.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/corrida-sao-martinho-da-gandara-2027\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Palavras R\u00e1pidas e Junta de Freguesia de S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida de S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 1\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 7 de fevereiro de 2027, com partida e chegada na Junta de Freguesia de S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara, no concelho de Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is (Aveiro). A corrida de 10 km parte \u00e0s 09h45 e a caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 10h00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 10 de novembro de 2026 a 31 de janeiro de 2027 (ou at\u00e9 atingir 400 vagas na corrida e 200 na caminhada). At\u00e9 10 de dezembro, a Corrida 10 km custa 11,00 \u20ac e a Caminhada 5 km custa 8,00 \u20ac; ap\u00f3s 10 de dezembro, os valores passam para 14,00 \u20ac (Corrida) e 11,00 \u20ac (Caminhada).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e onde s\u00e3o levantados os dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, T-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimento l\u00edquido e s\u00f3lido (aos 5 km e na meta) e medalha finisher. O levantamento de dorsais decorre na Junta de Freguesia de S\u00e3o Martinho da G\u00e2ndara no dia 6 de fevereiro (09h00\u201313h00 e 15h00\u201318h00) e no dia 7 de fevereiro (07h45\u201309h00).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existem pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios e escal\u00f5es na corrida de 10 km?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9us para os 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (S\u00e9nior 18-40, M\/F 40, M\/F 50 e M\/F 60), s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 5 primeiros da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral masculina e feminina: 100 \u20ac (1\u00ba), 50 \u20ac (2\u00ba), 30 \u20ac (3\u00ba), 20 \u20ac (4\u00ba) e 10 \u20ac (5\u00ba).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite para concluir a prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo m\u00e1ximo de prova \u00e9 de 2 horas (at\u00e9 \u00e0s 11h45), momento a partir do qual o tr\u00e2nsito rodovi\u00e1rio \u00e9 reaberto.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":71299,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28],"event_type_2":[34,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-71297","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-oliveira-de-azemeis-aveiro","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type_2-aveiro","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-corrida-de-sao-martinho-da-gandara-gold-residence.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/71297","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}]